{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_06",
  "title": "领主宅邸攻防战",
  "storyCode": "OD-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4490733362647d0fa74a3e21467032a9ae93ce87e24eafa33dc00ac9df228b5d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我们有多久没见面了，我亲爱的妹妹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "半年，一年，还是更久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "德鲁奇，你袭击领主卫队，攻占领主府邸，这是在谋反！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "谋反，哼，呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你应该知道，皮加尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "如果不是老头子那腐朽的脑袋里还想着保护他那些感染的......啊，劣质资产。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这位子根本轮不到你坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "冷静点，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "看看这个，这些玩具来自一位哥伦比亚的热心赞助商。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "TSW-2号超声波冲击装置，高精尖工业产品，尚未投入实战的实验武器，唯一的缺点是尺寸太大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我把它藏在镇子里，可是花了不少时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "把你从大宅里骗出来，也花了我不少时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "所以我亲爱的妹妹，你那强大的武技起到什么作用了？你坚强的意志又起到什么作用了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你再看看这些朋友，这些萨卡兹朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "他们可不是那些死脑筋的魔族佬，他们同样来自哥伦比亚，他们为钱办事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你知道这代表着什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "他们代表着更先进的东西，是你和老头子永远都不会明白的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "只要利润够高，金钱能汇聚的力量远超你的想象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "老头子坚持的那些狗屁不通的道理，现在又到哪儿去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "老大，我们在一间大房子里找到了这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "哦，巴耶勒王酋的领主委任书。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "细纹草纸，绣边签名，砖块一样的巴耶勒文，还有这黝黑盖章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "老头子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "没有，我们找遍了所有房间，大宅里只有一大群镇民，没看到你说的老头子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "父亲已经过世了，现在我就是长泉镇的领主。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "你违抗领主，就是违抗王酋，你已经死罪难逃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这就是你和那个老东西想出来的计谋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "唔呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "老东西真的是越来越蠢了。你们居然觉得依靠王酋就能将我一军，你真的是天真得可笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "死罪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "老头子引以为豪的瑞柏巴卫队现在就躺在巷子里身首异处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "最棘手的领主卫队已经没了，你觉得这里还有谁能管我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "你这个丧心病狂的废物！他们从小看着你长大！你竟然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "他们不该挡我的道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你也不该。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "看在我们血脉相连的份上，我就讲得再直白一点，便于你理解吧，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "是，你现在是萨尔贡的领主，没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "而我呢？我只是一个被家族放逐的流浪汉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "但过个几年，等到你不幸亡故，再由我亲自去一趟巴耶勒王廷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我既有血统，又带着矿产和大笔财富向王酋表忠心，你觉得他会不会把长泉镇重新分封给我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我再好心地做一个假设，如果你上任没多久就在一场血战中丧生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我把你的遗体献给王酋，假若你有幸成为长生军的一员，我会不会因此获得更多好处？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "德鲁奇，你这个卑鄙无耻的败类！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "别这么激动，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "当然，前述内容都只是我的假设，假设不会成真，这只是兄妹谈心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "因为我早就想好了更适合你的去处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "看到这些身上带石块的东西吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "既然你那么愿意保护感染者，不妨就加入他们吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "德鲁奇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "等你因此而亡的时候，我会找个山洞把你填进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这样，你和老头就能看着我是怎么把矿洞底下深藏的源石挖出来，让长泉镇变成整个巴耶勒的矿产中心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "怎么，不说话了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "......你在出卖你的家族，出卖这片土地！我诅咒你，德鲁奇，你不得好死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "随你开心，我亲爱的妹妹，你想咒多久就咒多久，趁你还有本事说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "那就这样吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）你，过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）老板，你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把那些感染者带到学者那边去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "咳咳......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）好的，我把他们带给科学家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）这个年轻人呢？看起来快不行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）是死是活都带过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）至于我妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把她变成感染者，你们萨卡兹人肯定知道怎么弄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）不过这可不是合同规定的工作内容，得加钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）别那么多废话。往长远看，等我们的事成了，矿山运作起来，有的是钱可分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "你可真是有个好哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "（闭上了眼睛）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（举起武器）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "还有敌人！架盾，保护头儿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "怎么回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "头儿，还有敌人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "领主卫队的人不是都被干掉了吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "我看见了！我看见了！那是个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "术师，快让怪物动起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师雇佣兵",
      "text": "稍等......我看看......这个要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "动作搞快一点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "啊啊啊！我的肩膀！我的肩膀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "不要慌乱，敌人在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "没......没看到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "先撤退，敌人有弓弩，别待在空旷地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "掩护德鲁奇老板，他可不能出事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "我看到了！是个菲林！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "小心！撤退！撤退！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "是你......你是罗德岛的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你还能动吗，瑞柏巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石畸变体",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师雇佣兵",
      "text": "好，动起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师雇佣兵",
      "text": "她们没有胜算的，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "哼，那老家伙做的玩具也就这时候还有点用处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "其他人和怪物一起上，把她们解决掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "这里敌人太多，我没法保证能让你平安离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "这就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "我的武器在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "德鲁奇能做到这一步都是我的疏忽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "我没有脸面去见长眠的父亲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "但就算死，我也要把这叛徒的心挖出来给长泉陪葬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "别冲动，敌人太多，这样行动必死无疑，你需要为这座城镇活下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我已经给其他人发了信号，他们很快就到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "老板，那些佣兵和罗德岛的人正在攻击我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "怕什么，这宅邸固若金汤，就凭几个佣兵又能怎么样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "让术师操纵怪物干掉那个菲林。其他人守住入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "报告目标情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "他们利用院墙建立了防线，有狙击手，墙后面应该有不少大块头佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "老样子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这种墙壁，也太小看我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "是时候给他们点颜色看看了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "墙上被炸了一个大洞？原来还有这样的技术。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "火力压制！准备突入！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "不要让他们进来，上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "别碍事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "还没完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "混账东西！狙击手呢！狙击手在干什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "已经没有什么狙击手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "你，你是从哪儿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "外墙已突破！干得漂亮，老爷子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "不要放松警惕，还有很多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "等等，他们推了一台什么东西出来?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "卧倒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "咳咳......我的耳朵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你没事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "我没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "其他人呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "都还好，但是我现在觉得五脏六腑都在疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "......这是什么武器？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "他们怎么连这种东西都拉出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "沃尔沃特科钦斯基的实验性武器......真是没想到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这可麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "又来了！找掩体！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "被这个东西打到绝对没命了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "头儿，他、他们攻破外墙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你没看到他们都被压制了么，你在怕什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "先搞定我的妹妹和那个菲林，然后我们再来解决其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "优势在我这边，无非只是再多杀几个人而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "五个！这就是你的怪物吗？德鲁奇！滚出来面对我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "六个！你们这些丑陋肮脏的怪物，来啊！我要把你们全都砸成碎片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "冷静一点，皮加尔小姐，节省体力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "它们......数量太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "不......咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "皮加尔大人......黑小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "医生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "你们......咳，咳......快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "来吧，怪物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（痛......好痛。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（我在哪儿......我晕倒了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（这是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "......你在出卖你的家族，出卖这片土地！我诅咒你，德鲁奇，你不得好死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（皮加尔大人！跪在地上？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（出什么事了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（啊......痛......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "咳咳......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（这是......血？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（痛......好冷。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把那些感染者带到学者那边去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）好的，我把他们带给科学家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）这个年轻人呢？看起来快不行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）是死是活都带过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）至于我妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把她变成感染者，你们萨卡兹人肯定知道怎么弄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（他......他要对感染者做什么？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（站不起来......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（那是谁......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（是黑小姐......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（只有一个人......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（得帮帮她......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（哈......最终还是要用这种方法。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "你们......快逃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你要做什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "别管我！快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "那是精炼源石锭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你这是要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "源石技艺......很久没有用过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（还有很多想做的事情。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（还不想死......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "text": "（医生的天职就是拯救生命，我在......拯救......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师雇佣兵",
      "text": "我的眼睛！我的眼睛！啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "站起来！保持阵型！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "咳咳......咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "怎么回事......那是什么啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "畸变体，畸变体不受控制了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "超声波发生器呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "被那个混小子炸坏了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "全都失控了！怎么办？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "text": "咕哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "菲林又开始攻击了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "text": "架盾，保护老板！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "德鲁奇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "text": "我要你偿命！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你们到底在磨蹭什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我现在就要这群家伙人头落地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "又怎么了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "找到了，他们都在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "救人要紧，开火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
